 in atomic mass.\n(D): The atom becomes negatively charged.\n\nAssistant: Let's think step by step:\n", "specificity_preds": [], "specificity_probs": [], "new_cot": "", "new_cot_probs": [], "cot_prob": [-0.3890148401260376], "cot_step_prob": [-5.4991583824157715]}}}
{"id": "Mercury_400687", "question": "Which statement best explains why a tree branch floats on water?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): Wood is porous.", "B): Wood is buoyant.", "C): Wood is light.", "D): Wood is magnetic."], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. A tree branch floats on water.\n2. Floating is caused by buoyancy.\n3. Buoyancy is the upward force exerted by a fluid on an object immersed in it.\n4. Wood is a material that can float on water.\n5. The best explanation for why a tree branch floats on water is that wood is buoyant.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.9980111726501946e-09, 1.4734531760041136e-05, 7.580159278042231e-10, 2.4609175808265604e-10], "initial_probs": [6.7971195676364005e-06, 0.0001547017163829878, 9.695570923895502e-08, 2.777827390332277e-08], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "Mercury_400687_step_1", "global_job_index": 1296, "cot_step": "A tree branch floats on water.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "A tree branch floats on water.", "2.", "Floating is caused by buoyancy.", "3.", "Buoyancy is the upward force exerted by a fluid on an object immersed in it.", "4.", "Wood is a material that can float on water.", "5.", "The best explanation for why a tree branch floats on water is that wood is buoyant."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_400687_step_1", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s0/Mercury_400687_step_1.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_400687", "step_idx": 1, "target_index": 168, "global_job_index": 1296, "question": "Which statement best explains why a tree branch floats on water?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=Fal