{"id": "Mercury_400811", "question": "To produce light, the atoms inside a light bulb transform electrical energy into what other kind of energy?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): heat", "B): chemical", "C): mechanical", "D): electromagnetic"], "correct": "D", "initial_cot": "1. We know that light bulbs convert electrical energy into light.\n2. The question asks what other kind of energy is produced during this process.\n3. We can eliminate options (B) and (C) because they are not related to the production of light.\n4. Between (A) and (D), we need to determine which one is the correct answer.", "initial_cot_probs": [1.0097669473907445e-05, 1.0433897301709294e-08, 3.8384162515114895e-09, 2.2530946353072068e-06], "initial_probs": [0.0001247880281880498, 3.7682718811993254e-06, 8.408151188632473e-07, 0.0001602309785084799], "prediction": 3, "cot_prediction": 0, "adapter_id": "Mercury_400811_step_1", "global_job_index": 1554, "cot_step": "We know that light bulbs convert electrical energy into light.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "We know that light bulbs convert electrical energy into light.", "2.", "The question asks what other kind of energy is produced during this process.", "3.", "We can eliminate options (B) and (C) because they are not related to the production of light.", "4.", "Between (A) and (D), we need to determine which one is the correct answer."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_400811_step_1", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s0/Mercury_400811_step_1.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_400811", "step_idx": 1, "target_index": 198, "global_job_index": 1554, "question": "To produce light, the atoms inside a light bulb transform electrical energy into