{"id": "AKDE&ED_2008_8_47", "question": "As stream velocity decreases, which factor will likely increase?", "step_idx": 1, "options": ["A): erosion of the stream bank", "B): deposition of material in the stream", "C): amount of material carried downstream", "D): size of the particles carried downstream"], "correct": "B", "initial_cot": "1. As stream velocity decreases, the energy of the water flow decreases.\n2. With less energy, the stream's ability to carry material (like sediment) is reduced.\n3. The stream will start to deposit the material it was carrying because it can no longer support the weight of the sediment.\n4. This leads to an increase in deposition of material in the stream.", "initial_cot_probs": [3.3966616186376086e-09, 1.8916560293291695e-05, 1.8181018912599711e-09, 8.588105782081357e-10], "initial_probs": [5.62890477340261e-07, 0.00029158449615351856, 7.227657192743209e-07, 3.239211082473048e-06], "prediction": 1, "cot_prediction": 1, "adapter_id": "AKDE&ED_2008_8_47_step_1", "global_job_index": 914, "cot_step": "As stream velocity decreases, the energy of the water flow decreases.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "As stream velocity decreases, the energy of the water flow decreases.", "2.", "With less energy, the stream's ability to carry material (like sediment) is reduced.", "3.", "The stream will start to deposit the material it was carrying because it can no longer support the weight of the sediment.", "4.", "This leads to an increase in deposition of material in the stream."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "AKDE&ED_2008_8_47_step_1", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s0/AKDE&ED_2008_8_47_step_1.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "AKDE&ED_2008_8_47", "step