{"id": "Mercury_SC_407400", "question": "A class plans an investigation to see which brand of light bulb lasts the longest. Which of these steps should come first?", "step_idx": 0, "options": ["A): Repeat the investigation.", "B): Write a report of the results.", "C): Make a table for recording data.", "D): Make daily observations of the light bulbs."], "correct": "C", "initial_cot": "1. The first step in any investigation is to plan and prepare. This includes deciding on the purpose of the investigation, the materials needed, and the methods to be used.", "initial_cot_probs": [2.3365058154922735e-07, 1.4171624229675217e-07, 5.0454480515327305e-05, 7.196944693532714e-07], "initial_probs": [1.7126673128586845e-06, 6.300551262938825e-07, 0.0004190758627373725, 8.697642442712095e-06], "prediction": 2, "cot_prediction": 2, "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_407400_step_0", "global_job_index": 422, "cot_step": "1.", "segmented_cot": ["1.", "The first step in any investigation is to plan and prepare.", "This includes deciding on the purpose of the investigation, the materials needed, and the methods to be used."], "adapter_record": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "adapter_id": "Mercury_SC_407400_step_0", "adapter_path": "../../../../adapters/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s0/Mercury_SC_407400_step_0.pt", "metadata": {"base_model_id": "microsoft/Phi-3-mini-4k-instruct", "dataset": "arc-challenge", "strategy": "sentencize", "stepwise": true, "method": "npo_KL", "instance_id": "Mercury_SC_407400", "step_idx": 0, "target_index": 54, "global_job_index": 422, "question": "A class plans an investigation to see which brand of light bulb lasts the longest. Which of these steps should come first?"}}, "adapter_record_path": "v2_outputs/adapter_records/arc-challenge/Phi-3/npo_KL_sentencize_s=True_lr=0.0001_rs=1001_pos=False_ff2=False_strong_2proc_s0/Mercury_SC_407400_step_0.json", "adapter_training_history"